# Combine positive and negative

variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(-57772.3298549715+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(-57772.3298549715+58079.3149044335)
